- All three spikes fall in the **same month (2025-12)** — the final month of the dataset — which is a classic channel-stuffing / year-end push signature (spikes concentrated at period end, no following months available to confirm continuation).
- E-Service spike (3,654) sits on an **upward trend** (prev 3 months: 2,428 → 2,595 → 3,253) and its return rate (0.74%) is *below* the series' 24-month average (0.78%) — more consistent with genuine demand.
