- E-Hardware spike (1,483) is on a gradual uptrend (1,069 → 1,189 → 1,369) but its return rate (2.83%) is *below* the series average (3.92%), so returns did not spike with volume — weak stuffing evidence, though the ratio is the smallest of the three.

